nment built this national optic backbone in the initial stage</strong>, followed by a facilitation role in the growth stage.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <figure class=\"footer-logo placeholder\" style=\"margin:0;\">[Logo: BTRC emblem]</figure>\n  <div class=\"footer-text\">Bangladesh Telecommunication Regulatory Commission</div>\n  <div class=\"footer-email\">rhassan@btrc.gov.bd</div>\n  <div class=\"footer-page\">10</div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
